          "eyebrow": "The Story",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "An Evening That Became",
            "accent": "a Gift"
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "On July 20, 2024, in Maiori, the atmosphere was light, natural, and full of real emotions. This photoshoot was a gift from Juliet to her friend — that's why most of the photos feature her. At the end, we also captured photos of them together to preserve the feeling of their trip and friendship.",
            "It was a story about two friends traveling along the Amalfi Coast — walking through the town, talking, laughing at simple things, and feeling time slow down for a while. These sessions always feel authentic because people are simply living their moment, while I capture it.",
            "A photoshoot as a gift is different from a physical present. It gives an experience, emotions, and professional photos that stay with you for years."
          ]
        }
      ]
